          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Overview"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Capgo is a cloud-based platform that helps developers streamline their Capacitor app development process by making it easy to manage and deploy Over-The-Air (OTA) updates. In this blog article, we will cover all of the key features and benefits of Capgo, including how to deploy updates, manage channels, track devices, and configure update strategies. We will also discuss Capgo's use cases and pricing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "By the end of this article, you will have a deep understanding of how Capgo can help you to improve your Capacitor app development process and deliver better apps to your users."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 8,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Feature"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 10,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Capgo offers a variety of features that make it easy to manage Capacitor app updates, including:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "location": {
        "line": 12,
        "column": 1
      },
      "ordered": false,
      "start": null,
      "spread": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 12,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 12,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 12,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "OTA updates: Capgo makes it easy to deploy updates to your users' devices without having to re-install the app. You can simply create a new release in Capgo and upload the update bundle. Capgo will then automatically deploy the update to your users' devices."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 14,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 14,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 14,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Channel Management: Capgo provides channels (like Production, Staging, Dev) that allow you to test updates with specific groups of devices before rolling them out to all users. This helps you catch bugs early and ensure updates work properly."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 16,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 16,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 16,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "CI/CD Integration: Capgo can be easily integrated with your CI/CD pipeline. This allows you to automate the upload and deployment of update bundles."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 18,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 18,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 18,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Device Management: Capgo tracks devices that have your app installed and allows you to control which devices receive updates through channels. This is useful for beta testing or rolling out updates to specific device groups."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 20,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 20,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 20,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Update Configuration: Capgo allows you to manage update strategies, rollback settings, and channel configurations in a central location. This makes it easier to control how and when updates are delivered to your users."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
