          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 48,
                "column": 5
              },
              "text": "Embracing Agile Development:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 50,
        "column": 3
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 50,
            "column": 3
          },
          "text": "Web developers can embrace agile practices with Capgo. Best practices include planning for iteration, thorough testing, continuous user feedback gathering, performance monitoring, effective collaboration, and staying updated with Capgo's evolving features and best practices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 52,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
